{
  "name": "dsh-model-quick-switch",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "快捷键 ⌘⌥U（Windows / Linux 上是 Ctrl+Alt+U）弹出快捷菜单：顶部「新建工作树」「团队协作」开关直接作用于当前会话，两行格式一致（角标只有「操作」、副标题只报开启 / 关闭；无会话或对应服务缺席时隐藏，工作区不是 Git 仓库时工作树行隐藏；工作树请求在发送首条消息时创建），下面是从设置页维护的模型列表选模型；模型公布了思考等级时再选一档，最后切换当前会话使用的模型。浮层里的模型来自本插件在设置页维护的列表，可在「设置 → 模型快速切换」里从 Host 模型目录中按提供方添加、删除。",
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./index.ts"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsdown",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "check:css": "node check-css.mjs",
    "test": "node test/run-all.mjs",
    "check": "node --check lib/client.js && node --check index.ts"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "~3.19.0"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "~4.1.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "~4.1.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-settings": "^0.2.2-rc.2",
    "@types/react": "^18.3.31",
    "@types/react-dom": "^18.3.7",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1",
    "tsdown": "^0.23.5",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3"
  }
}
